@section verification_testing Verification and How to Run

| Test | What it locks down |
|---|---|
| `test_husky_detour.py` | Lethal thresholds, corridor choice, reverse turn, line of sight |
| `test_husky_pin_view.py` | Standoff pose, 4 m steps, target order |
| `test_husky_ice_visual_confirm.py`, `test_husky_pose_correction.py` | Five-frame vote and slope projection |
| `test_ice_rgbd_detector.py` | Colour gate and radial bulge |
| `test_scan_ground_filter_pitch.py`, `test_husky_bumper_stop.py` | Ramp removal and solid-hit recovery |
| `test_ice_target_tracker.py` | Merge radius, ready gating, nearest-first order, confirmed tracks leave the queue |
| `test_husky_ice_priority.py` | Severity score: mid-span medium sleeve is HIGH, near-tower small sleeve is LOW |
| `test_detection_viewer.py`, `test_husky_path_log.py` | HUD layout and evidence filenames |

@verbatim
cd ~/41068_ws/src/MinhandOwen
python3 -m pytest test/

ros2 launch 41068_ignition_bringup ice_pin_view.launch.py block_count:=4 enable_console:=true enable_viewer:=true
ros2 launch 41068_ignition_bringup 41068_operator_ui.launch.py
@endverbatim

